flowchart LR
  U[Patient or doctor] --> F[React + Vite frontend]
  F --> A[FastAPI routes]
  A --> DB[(SQLite by default / PostgreSQL configured)]
  A --> DS[DiagnosisService]
  DS --> AD[AgentAdapter]
  AD --> O[OrchestratorAgent]
  O --> S[EnhancedSymptomParser]
  S --> D[DiagnosisAgent]
  D --> X[Optional DXGPT API]
  D --> LF[Local condition fallback]
  O --> L[LiteratureAgent]
  L --> P[PubMed and ClinicalTrials.gov]
  O --> C[CaseStudyAgent]
  C --> PP[PubMed case reports]
  O --> E[ExplainabilityAgent]
  O --> W[Safety warning rules]
  A --> H[Health passport and records]
  A --> M[OpenStreetMap / Overpass / Nominatim]
  A --> J[Jitsi consultation room]
  A --> R[Reminder scheduler / notification adapter]
  F --> Q[Research Mode read-only status]
  Q -.-> RS[research scripts and saved evidence]
